	(text_box "Break Out Board\n	• Headers for Microcontroller board, with a socket for each pin to be broken out if needed\n	• XT30 connector, allowing a 2S battery, therefore needing a 5V0 regulator and maybe 3V3\n	• 2 JST ZH headers for the motor with encoder connection\n	• 2 Servo connector headers\n	• I2C header\n	• SPI header\n	• UART header\n	• Header for the LineFollower Sparkfun strip\n	• Header for the I2C OLED, or have OLED on board\n	• LEDS x 4 ( one each of RED, GREEN, BLUE and YELLOW )\n	• Two larger buttons for digital input to the micro\n	• PCB should be RED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 228.6 0)
		(size 101.6 50.8)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
